<title>USA: NYSE suspends Florida Power QUIDS.</title>
<headline>NYSE suspends Florida Power QUIDS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said it has suspended trading of Florida Power &amp; Light Co 8.75 percent quarterly income debt securities.</p>
<p>An exchange spokesman noted the securities had been redeemed.</p>
<p>Florida Power is an FPL Group Inc subsidiary.</p>
<p>Elise Porter, a spokeswoman for the utility, said the redemption, effective March 26, had been announced in newspaper advertisements in February, adding the company is &quot;not required to put out any statement.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- Jim Brumm 212-859-1710.))</p>
